                    // We'll set a flag in opts to indicate glob case insensitive.
                    // But opts doesn't have such flag; we will treat this flag as enabling case insensitive for globs.
                    // We'll push a special glob that toggles? Easier: add field.
                    // For simplicity, we will just set a boolean in opts (we already have? not) - we can reuse ignore_file_case_insensitive? No.
